  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender and Infrastructure Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a grant of CAD 99,663 from the Canadian Government in partnership with the AfDB, Germany and the World Bank, the expected outcome is the development of an action plan to mainstream gender equality in infrastructure policies and projects, including the transport, energy, water &amp; sanitation and irrigation sectors. The immediate output is the mainstreaming of gender to the Bank&#x2019;s new energy strategy and action plan. The startup of the activity was delayed by the political turmoil in Tunis in January 2011, leading to the postponement of the Workshop to be held in Addis Ababa Ethiopia to March 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
